{"id":"c0dd9ffea872a14a","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-ball.md","title":"Ball","display":"df-ball — Ball","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-ball","aliases":["58-df-ball","Ball"],"display":"df-ball — Ball","depends_on":["[[58-df-metric-space]]","[[58-df-powerset]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-ball"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-ball</span><span>Ball</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ball — Ball"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ce876585d129ce97\" href=\"?note=ce876585d129ce97\" title=\"58-df-metric-space\">58-df-metric-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"58-df-powerset\">58-df-powerset</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,d\\in V\">\\(X,d\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:X\\times X\\to\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\">\\(d:X\\times X\\to\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)\">\\(\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ce876585d129ce97\" href=\"?note=ce876585d129ce97\" title=\"58-df-metric-space\">58-df-metric-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in X\">\\(x\\in X\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\mathbb{R}_{&gt;0}\">\\(r\\in\\mathbb{R}_{&gt;0}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_d,\\overline B_d:X\\times\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\to\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(B_d,\\overline B_d:X\\times\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\to\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_d\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(X))\">\\(\\tau_d\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(X))\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ball\\text{-}open} \\vdash B_d(x,r)\\coloneqq\\{y\\in X:d(x,y)&lt;r\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ball\\text{-}open} \\vdash B_d(x,r)\\coloneqq\\{y\\in X:d(x,y)&lt;r\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ball\\text{-}closed} \\vdash \\overline{B}_d(x,r)\\coloneqq\\{y\\in X:d(x,y)\\leq r\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ball\\text{-}closed} \\vdash \\overline{B}_d(x,r)\\coloneqq\\{y\\in X:d(x,y)\\leq r\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ball\\text{-}topology} \\vdash \\tau_d\\coloneqq\\{U\\subseteq X:\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\land\\forall y\\in U\\;\\exists\\epsilon\\in\\mathbb{R}_{&gt;0}\\;(B_d(y,\\epsilon)\\subseteq U)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ball\\text{-}topology} \\vdash \\tau_d\\coloneqq\\{U\\subseteq X:\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\land\\forall y\\in U\\;\\exists\\epsilon\\in\\mathbb{R}_{&gt;0}\\;(B_d(y,\\epsilon)\\subseteq U)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Ball: set of points within distance <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> of center; metric topology basis</li>\n<li>Bounded: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> bounded <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iff\">\\(\\iff\\)</span> exists <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R: X \\subseteq B(x,R)\">\\(R: X \\subseteq B(x,R)\\)</span> for some <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span></li>\n<li>Precompact: totally bounded if covered by finitely many <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\">\\(\\epsilon\\)</span>-balls for any <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon &gt; 0\">\\(\\epsilon &gt; 0\\)</span></li>\n<li>Every open ball is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_d\">\\(\\tau_d\\)</span>-open, every closed ball is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_d\">\\(\\tau_d\\)</span>-closed, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline{B_d(x,r)}\\subseteq\\overline B_d(x,r)\">\\(\\overline{B_d(x,r)}\\subseteq\\overline B_d(x,r)\\)</span>; equality need not hold in an arbitrary metric space.</li>\n<li>The metric codomain and power-set-valued ball operators are now explicit parts of the signature.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Munkres, Topology</li>\n<li>Willard, General Topology</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-metric-space","status":"resolved","id":"ce876585d129ce97","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-metric-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-powerset","status":"resolved","id":"2b6b1d9eb78a2714","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-powerset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-metric-space","status":"resolved","id":"ce876585d129ce97","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$, $d:X\\times X\\to\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}$, and $\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)$ (see [[58-df-metric-space]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,d\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"d:X\\times X\\to\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in X","display":false},{"tex":"r\\in\\mathbb{R}_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"B_d,\\overline B_d:X\\times\\mathbb R_{>0}\\to\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_d\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(X))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ball\\text{-}open} \\vdash B_d(x,r)\\coloneqq\\{y\\in X:d(x,y)<r\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ball\\text{-}closed} \\vdash \\overline{B}_d(x,r)\\coloneqq\\{y\\in X:d(x,y)\\leq r\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ball\\text{-}topology} \\vdash \\tau_d\\coloneqq\\{U\\subseteq X:\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\land\\forall y\\in U\\;\\exists\\epsilon\\in\\mathbb{R}_{>0}\\;(B_d(y,\\epsilon)\\subseteq U)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\iff","display":false},{"tex":"R: X \\subseteq B(x,R)","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon > 0","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_d","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_d","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline{B_d(x,r)}\\subseteq\\overline B_d(x,r)","display":false}],"bytes":1542,"backlinks":[{"id":"f2a6240dd17a4197","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8a5419e2086c0add","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$B_d(x,r)$ (metric ball, see [[../batch03/58-df-ball.md]])"},{"id":"6615a57b9cb224a4","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$B_d(x,r)$ (open metric ball, see [[../batch03/58-df-ball.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-167","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-ball.md|58-df-ball]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["ce876585d129ce97","2b6b1d9eb78a2714"]}